                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course aims to cultivate research ability in undergraduate nursing students, with a focus on inspiring innovative thinking, fostering research skills, and nurturing research literacy. The curriculum&nbsp; covers an the history and future of nursing research, research topic, literature review, quantitative research design,sampling，instrument, data collection&nbsp; data analysis, qualitative research,&nbsp; writing of proposals&nbsp; and research papers. Adopting a task-driven approach, the course combines theoretical instruction with research design activities to help students master nursing research knowledge and skills， and develop an innovative ideas and the spirit of rigorous and truth-seeking science.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
