            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc;  border: 1px solid #000000; height: 258px; width: 870px;" border="1" width="863">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>周次</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>内容</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>教学目标</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>1</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>护理研究概&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 研究问题的确立</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>熟悉护理研究概念、常用科研设计类型；掌握护理研究基本步骤、科研伦理原则；掌握研究目的撰写方法。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>文献检索、文献综述写作</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>掌握文献检索方法和步骤；熟悉常用中英文数据库；掌握检索策略。掌握护理类综述的撰写方法。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>3</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>分组讨论1：研究问题、研究目的、检索框架</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>通过作业和讨论，培养确立研究问题、撰写研究目的以及开展文献检索的能力</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>4</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>科研设计方法（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 20px; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="312">
<p>掌握研究设计的基本原则、常用护理研究类型的特点、各类研究类型的具体科研设计方案</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>5</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>科研设计方法（二）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>6</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>总体、样本、抽样方法</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>熟悉总体、样本与误差的概念；学会抽样的方法；学会样本含量的估算。&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 40px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>7</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 40px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>分组讨论2：科研设计、抽样方法</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 40px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>通过作业和讨论，培养根据研究目的选择合适科研设计类型，确定研究对象以及抽样方法的能力。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>8</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>研究工具&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>熟悉常用研究工具类型；熟悉问卷编制的基本方法；掌握研究工具性能测评方法以及量表汉化方法。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 20px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>9</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 20px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>资料收集方法&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 20px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>熟悉护理研究常用资料收集方法；能为不同研究变量和研究内容设计资料收集方案。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 16px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>10</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 16px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>资料分析方法&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 16px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>掌握资料整理的步骤；统计分析的基本概念；科研资料的类型、常用的统计分析方法。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>11</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>统计软件的使用与实操</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>掌握spss的操作，并能初步应用进行数据的分析</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 59px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>12</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 59px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>分组讨论3：研究工具、资料收集与分析</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 59px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>通过作业和讨论，培养选择合适研究工具、制定资料收集与分析方案的能力。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>13</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>质性研究</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>理解质性研究的特点；掌握质性研究基本过程；掌握质性研究问题的确定、研究对象的选择、握质性研究的资料收集和分析的方法。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>14</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>科研设计书、科研论文写作</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>能根据写作规范，撰写研究论文和研究计划书</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 48px; height: 13px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="87">
<p>15</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 214px; height: 13px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="180">
<p>质性研究作业汇报</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 559px; height: 13px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>通过作业和讨论，掌握质性研究的科研设计</p>
</td>
</tr>
